B.aEz=new A.c7("Membership plans (Weekly, Monthly, Annual \u2014 auto-renewing) and Bamboo packs on iOS / Android are paid through the Apple App Store or Google Play. We never receive or store card numbers or payment details. We only receive the product ID, the store transaction / receipt ID, its status, plan and expiry, so our server can verify it with Apple / Google, grant the perks, restore purchases and handle refunds. You cancel renewal in your App Store / Google Play settings. The web version has no purchases.")
