B.amN=s(["Purchase records","For the period accounting and tax laws require; then deleted or anonymised."],t.s)
B.aqY=s(["Weekly / monthly leaderboard scores",'With the account; deleted when the account is deleted. With "Hide me from the leaderboards" on, scores are still counted but not shown to anyone else.'],t.s)
