B.aEq=new A.c7("Pandlish is offline-first: the following is stored on your device first, so the app opens fast and works offline, and is synced with your account when you are online (during a trial without an account it stays on the device and is never sent to the Pandlish server):")
B.af1=s(["Learning progress: the certificate (A1\u2013B2) you chose, your floor and stage on the Bamboo Path, answers, your spaced-repetition review schedule (SM-2) and saved words.","In-game wallet and items: Bamboo energy, Gold, experience (EXP), level, streak and power-up items.","Settings: interface language, voice (voice, speed, pitch), sound and haptics.","SquidType history: score, words, accuracy, typing speed and time of your latest runs.","An offline sync log, sent to the server when you are online."],t.s)
B.aE3=new A.eI(B.af1)
B.aF3=new A.c7("On iOS and Android the data lives in a SQLite database in the app's private storage, which other apps cannot read. The Pandlish website is a showcase only and keeps no learning progress: your browser just keeps your language, the SquidType word list (IndexedDB / Origin Private File System) and the history of the SquidType runs you play on the web (IndexedDB, never sent to the server). The website uses no advertising or tracking cookies.")
B.aEg=new A.w7("To delete it from the device: log out (the account's learning data is removed from the device), sign in to an existing account (the trial progress is removed, not merged into that account), uninstall the app or, on the web, clear Pandlish's site data in your browser settings. Synced data stays in your account until you delete the account.")
B.agX=s([B.aEq,B.aE3,B.aF3,B.aEg],t.L)
