B.aeZ=s(["Vietnam: the Law on Personal Data Protection No. 91/2025/QH15 (in force since 1 January 2026) and its implementing Decree 356/2025/N\u0110-CP; Decree 13/2023/N\u0110-CP on personal data protection, the earlier regulation whose principles the Law carries forward.","European Union and United Kingdom: the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR / UK GDPR) when you use Pandlish from there.","United States: the Children's Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA) for children under 13, and the California Consumer Privacy Act as amended by the CPRA (CCPA) where it applies."],t.s)
